{"id":"9a1792a4c383672b","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-rcf.md","title":"Real Closed Fields","display":"df-rcf — Real Closed Fields","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-rcf","aliases":["57-df-rcf"],"display":"df-rcf — Real Closed Fields","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-field]]","[[57-df-total-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-rcf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-rcf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rcf — Real Closed Fields"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be21afa871789456\" href=\"?note=be21afa871789456\" title=\"57-df-field\">57-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Real-Closed-Fields\">Real Closed Fields</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak R\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})\">\\(\\mathfrak R\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=|\\mathfrak R|\">\\(R=|\\mathfrak R|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak R)=0\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak R)=0\\)</span>；环语言、特征、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}\\)</span> 与求值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}\">\\(\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be21afa871789456\" href=\"?note=be21afa871789456\" title=\"57-df-field\">57-df-field</a>。</li>\n<li>固定关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_R\\subseteq R^2\">\\(&lt;_R\\subseteq R^2\\)</span> 为环境参数；它不是偷偷加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\)</span> 的关系符号。下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_R,+_R,\\cdot_R\">\\(0_R,+_R,\\cdot_R\\)</span> 为结构解释。原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCF}(\\mathfrak R)\">\\(\\mathrm{RCF}(\\mathfrak R)\\)</span> 保留一元接口和原两个条件。多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的输入类型是有限系数列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(R^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalOrder}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalOrder}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a>。另外定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdField}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdField}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}\\)</span>，供确实需要通常有序实闭域条件的定理使用；二者不替代原 RCF 谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCF}(\\mathfrak R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\bigl[\\forall x\\in R\\ \\exists y\\in R\\ (x=y\\cdot_R y\\lor x+_R(y\\cdot_R y)=0_R)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in R^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists x\\in R\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(p,x)=0_R\\to\n\\exists y,z\\in R\\ [y&lt;_R x\\land x&lt;_R z\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}\\land\\forall w\\in R\\ (y&lt;_R w\\land w&lt;_R z\\to\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(p,w)=0_R)]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrdField}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak R)\\land\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(R,&lt;_R)\\land0_R&lt;_R1_R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\\n[(a&lt;_R b\\to a+_R c&lt;_R b+_R c)\\land\n(0_R&lt;_R a\\land0_R&lt;_R b\\to0_R&lt;_R a\\cdot_R b)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OrdField}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in R\\ (0_R&lt;_R a\\to\\exists b\\in R\\ (b\\cdot_R b=a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in R^{2m+2}\\\n(a_{2m+1}\\ne0_R\\to\\exists x\\in R\\ (\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(\\vec a,x)=0_R)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCF}(\\mathfrak R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\bigl[\\forall x\\in R\\ \\exists y\\in R\\ (x=y\\cdot_R y\\lor x+_R(y\\cdot_R y)=0_R)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in R^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists x\\in R\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(p,x)=0_R\\to\n\\exists y,z\\in R\\ [y&lt;_R x\\land x&lt;_R z\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}\\land\\forall w\\in R\\ (y&lt;_R w\\land w&lt;_R z\\to\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(p,w)=0_R)]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrdField}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak R)\\land\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(R,&lt;_R)\\land0_R&lt;_R1_R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\\n[(a&lt;_R b\\to a+_R c&lt;_R b+_R c)\\land\n(0_R&lt;_R a\\land0_R&lt;_R b\\to0_R&lt;_R a\\cdot_R b)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OrdField}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in R\\ (0_R&lt;_R a\\to\\exists b\\in R\\ (b\\cdot_R b=a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in R^{2m+2}\\\n(a_{2m+1}\\ne0_R\\to\\exists x\\in R\\ (\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(\\vec a,x)=0_R)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原多项式条件保留，包括其存在量词内部的蕴含；并未因它不标准而改写成“奇数次多项式有根”。但该 RCF 条件不能冒充通常的实闭域公理，也不能单独支持原量词消去结论。定理使用的通常条件以新谓词明确区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Real-Closed-Fields","text":"Real Closed Fields","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"be21afa871789456","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-total-order","status":"resolved","id":"1e5d7c3f7413640b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-total-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"be21afa871789456","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak R\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})$，$R=|\\mathfrak R|$，$\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak R)=0$；环语言、特征、$\\mathrm{Field}$ 与求值函数 $\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}$ 见 [[57-df-field]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-total-order","status":"resolved","id":"1e5d7c3f7413640b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TotalOrder}$ 见 [[57-df-total-order]]。另外定义 $\\mathrm{OrdField}$、$\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}$，供确实需要通常有序实闭域条件的定理使用；二者不替代原 RCF 谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak R\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})","display":false},{"tex":"R=|\\mathfrak R|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak R)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}","display":false},{"tex":"<_R\\subseteq R^2","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{ring}}","display":false},{"tex":"0_R,+_R,\\cdot_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RCF}(\\mathfrak R)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"R^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalOrder}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdField}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCF}(\\mathfrak R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\bigl[\\forall x\\in R\\ \\exists y\\in R\\ (x=y\\cdot_R y\\lor x+_R(y\\cdot_R y)=0_R)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in R^{<\\omega}\\ \\exists x\\in R\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(p,x)=0_R\\to\n\\exists y,z\\in R\\ [y<_R x\\land x<_R z\\\\\n&\\hspace{15em}\\land\\forall w\\in R\\ (y<_R w\\land w<_R z\\to\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(p,w)=0_R)]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrdField}(\\mathfrak R,<_R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak R)\\land\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(R,<_R)\\land0_R<_R1_R\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\\n[(a<_R b\\to a+_R c<_R b+_R c)\\land\n(0_R<_R a\\land0_R<_R b\\to0_R<_R a\\cdot_R b)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}(\\mathfrak R,<_R)\\longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{OrdField}(\\mathfrak R,<_R)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in R\\ (0_R<_R a\\to\\exists b\\in R\\ (b\\cdot_R b=a))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in R^{2m+2}\\\n(a_{2m+1}\\ne0_R\\to\\exists x\\in R\\ (\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}(\\vec a,x)=0_R)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2337,"backlinks":[{"id":"d5d65b2fd44760f8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}$ 保持 [[57-df-field]] 的原语言（其中没有 $<$）；$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^<$ 是其加入一个新二元关系符号 $<$ 的扩展，其他符号分区保持不变。$\\mathfrak R$ 是环语言结构，$<_R\\subseteq R^2$，$R=|\\mathfrak R|$；$\\mathfrak R^<$ 为把 $<$ 解释为 $<_R$ 的同载体扩张。$\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}$ 取 [[57-df-rcf]]，不把原 $\\mathrm{RCF}$ 谓词替换成它。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^<}$；$\\mathrm{QF}$ 与满足取 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]、[[57-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[57-df-dovf]]\n[[57-df-dovf-signature]]\n[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]\n[[57-df-dpll]]\n[[57-df-ef-game]]\n[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]\n[[57-df-equality-left]]\n[[57-df-equality-right]]\n[[57-df-equiv-left]]\n[[57-df-equiv-right]]\n[[57-df-existential-left]]\n[[57-df-existential-right